Subject: [PATCH 1/3] prefetch route data before rendering

Discussion routes waited for their queries to start after the component mounted,
which shows a spinner on every navigation. The route now warms the cache first.

- a shared query client that loaders can reach outside React
- query-options factories for the discussions endpoints
- a loader on the discussions route
